    "customfield_12311020": null,
    "customfield_12313320": "<div style='font-weight:bold;color:red;text-align:center'>This project has a <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/discussion.html\">user mailing list and an IRC channel</a> for support. If you are looking for support, or if you are not sure whether the behavior that you are observing is expected or not, please discuss it there first.</div>",
    "customfield_12314134": null,
    "duedate": null,
    "customfield_12314132": null,
    "customfield_12314131": null,
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12525663/comment/13120232",
          "id": "13120232",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "body": "Good catch Gilad ! Do you intend to prepare a patch?\n\nAlso, we probably shouldn't close the directory in close(), since it was given to us from the outside. So it's whoever created the directory responsibility to close it. We should however eliminate the two deprecated ctors which take a File -- no need to have them around anymore, and we're not bound to back-compat in this module, yet :).",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "created": "2011-10-04T15:53:43.749+0000",
          "updated": "2011-10-04T15:53:43.749+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12525663/comment/13120235",
          "id": "13120235",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=giladbarkai",
            "name": "giladbarkai",
            "key": "giladbarkai",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Gilad Barkai",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Thanks for the comment Shai.\n\nThe only Directory that is closed is the one that is NOT given - but rather wrapped around a given File.\nI agree that this constructor should be removed, I did not take care of it just yet...\n\nAttached a patch - Moving closer to IndexReader's ref counting paradigm, also introducing ensureClose().",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=giladbarkai",
            "name": "giladbarkai",
            "key": "giladbarkai",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Gilad Barkai",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2011-10-04T15:56:12.756+0000",
          "updated": "2011-10-04T15:57:30.884+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12525663/comment/13120247",
          "id": "13120247",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=giladbarkai",
            "name": "giladbarkai",
            "key": "giladbarkai",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Gilad Barkai",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Removed deprecated constructors, no private directory to close now.\n\nAlso fixed a small bug from the previous patch.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=giladbarkai",
            "name": "giladbarkai",
